<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Extraction Constraints:<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<span id="A2.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<span id="A2.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Evidence-Only Extraction</span><span id="A2.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">:
Only extract information that explicitly appears in the provided source content.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<span id="A2.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">No Inference or Fabrication</span><span id="A2.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">:
Do not infer, hallucinate, or supplement missing information.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<span id="A2.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Graceful Degradation</span><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">:
If a field cannot be extracted, return an empty object (</span><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{}</span><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">) or empty list (</span><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[]</span><span id="A2.I1.i3.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">).</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Output Requirements:<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A2.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A2.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The output must be a valid JSON object.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A2.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A2.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A2.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Do not include any content outside the specified JSON fields.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
