</pre>
<span id="A2.SS1.p6.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p6.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Task:<span id="A2.SS1.p6.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Evaluate whether the predicted answer correctly identifies the same entity as the ground-truth answer.</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p6.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p6.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Output Format:<span id="A2.SS1.p6.pic1.2.8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
Return the result as a valid JSON object with the following fields:</span></span></span>
